%N A223563 Number of n X n 0..1 arrays with antidiagonals unimodal.
%H A223563 R. H. Hardin, <a href="/A223563/b223563.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..99</a>
%F A223563 a(n) = (1 + (n*(n + 1)/2))*Product_{i=1..n-1} (1 + (i*(i + 1)/2))^2.
%F A223563 a(n) ~ 2^(1-2*n)*exp(-4*n)*n^(2+4*n)*cosh(sqrt(7)*Pi/2)^2. - _Stefano Spezia_, Sep 26 2026
